/tools/dataset-builder/.cache/

# Intentionally NOT ignored (commit these):
#   app/schemas/                         exported Room schemas, used by migration tests and the dataset builder
#   app/src/main/assets/databases/       capsules.db, the shipped asset database
#   tools/dataset-builder/overrides.yaml manual MBID overrides
#   tools/dataset-builder/src/main/resources/curated.tsv
